## Caching

Compiled with `--with-caching`. The cache is located by `WT_CACHE`; with it
unset every step simply runs. Only the sequential DAG caches — an async method
hands back a future, which has no stored form — so a run in async mode reports
every step as uncacheable. `result.json` carries a `cache` report saying what
each step's cache did and why.
